  #line-at(191.58pt, 295.35pt, " correspond to distinct measurement settings in the Bell–CHSH construction. ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 321.85pt, "These operators are uniquely fixed by the requirement of π-periodicity and sensitivity to the second ")
