  #line-at(72.025pt, 374.12pt, "A key structural consequence of this construction is that Bell–CHSH correlations depend exclusively on ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 386.87pt, "the second angular harmonic of the phase statistics. As a result, despite the apparent infinite ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 399.37pt, "dimensionality of the phase-resolved description, the relevant measurement statistics collapse onto a ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 412.12pt, "universal two-dimensional subspace spanned by the constant and second-harmonic angular modes. This ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 424.62pt, "subspace is fixed by the π-periodicity and second-harmonic dependence of CHSH observables; higher ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 437.65pt, "harmonics are orthogonal under the probability-weighted inner product induced by ")
